{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-autotier#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-autotier","commit":"897fb8714e74c9fd9c3b817fd48ba83ac991f286","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autotier 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的模型分档路由插件。它接入 agent 请求与模型选择流程，依据消息文本、工具、图像和会话信号判断意图，在强档、弱档及视觉档之间选择落点；复杂任务可先进入强档规划，再回到弱档实施。低置信度时可调用配置的裁判模型，失败可触发限时升级与回退。插件还提供弱档工具调用守卫、会话级 /tier 命令、状态和路由预演工具，以及 composer 档位按钮和设置卡片。安装后可配置模型档位、分类规则和守卫；裁判请求经宿主配置的模型 provider 发送，不需要插件专属密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:145-165","src/routing.ts:203-237","src/tools.ts:27-108","src/client/index.ts:70-112"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-autotier#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-autotier","commit":"897fb8714e74c9fd9c3b817fd48ba83ac991f286","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-autotier routes requests across model tiers by intent: complex work can be planned on a strong tier and implemented on a cheaper tier; image turns use a vision tier. It offers session overrides, status tools, and browser controls. Low-confidence judging uses the host model provider.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:145-165","src/routing.ts:203-237","src/tools.ts:27-108","src/client/index.ts:70-112"]}
